OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother day of bright or sunny
OL,6,Fintervals and occasional showers, some
OL,7,Fon the heavy side. Lighter winds for
OL,8,FShetland, a fresh west to
OL,9,Fnorthwesterly over Orkney.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells and a few light
OL,12,Fshowers in the evening. It will become
OL,13,Fmostly dry overnight as showers fade
OL,14,Faway.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FThe odd light shower possible
OL,17,Fat first, most likely for Shetland.
OL,18,FOtherwise dry with bright or sunny
OL,19,Fspells and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
