OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,6,Fbut breezy start Monday, soon turning
OL,7,Fcloudy with a little rain. Wet start
OL,8,FTuesday then sunshine and showers,
OL,9,Fgales. Cloudy and windy on Wednesday
OL,10,Fwith occasionally heavy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
